Three structuretemplate_ keys were added for ConstructCLI's tests. The world
is otherwise unmodified.

construct.mcstructure ships inside Construct's own behaviour pack
(Construct[BP]/structures/), from https://github.com/ForestOfLight/Construct.
It is committed here as the format 1 real-world codec fixture: a builder can prove
the codec self-consistent, but only a file the game wrote can prove it agrees
with the game.

format2-fences.mcstructure and format2-entity.mcstructure were exported from a
structure block by the game on 2026-09-17, and are the codec's fixtures for
format 2 — the layout described in docs/mcstructure-format-2.md. They are the
only files here the game wrote in that format, so they are what proves the
decoder agrees with it.
